[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:An Unusual Day]
[00:00.62]Lesson 57 | 第57课
[00:02.78]An unusual day | 不寻常的一天
[00:05.32]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.59]What is Mr. Sawyer doing tonight? | 萨维尔先生今晚在做什么？
[00:16.60]It is eight o'clock. | 八点了。
[00:20.22]The children go to school by car every day, | 孩子们每天都乘车上学，
[00:24.94]but today, they are going to school on foot. | 但今天他们步行上学。
[00:30.61]It is ten o'clock. | 十点了。
[00:33.16]Mrs. Sawyer usually stays at home in the morning, | 萨维尔夫人通常上午呆在家里，
[00:38.30]but this morning, she is going to the shops. | 但今天上午她要去商店。
[00:43.70]It is four o'clock. | 四点了。
[00:46.70]In the afternoon, Mrs. Sawyer usually drinks tea in the living room. | 下午，萨维尔夫人通常在客厅里喝茶。
[00:53.40]But this afternoon, she is drinking tea in the garden. | 但今天下午，她在花园里喝茶。
[00:59.87]It is six o'clock. | 六点了。
[01:03.11]In the evening, the children usually do their homework, | 晚上，孩子们通常做作业，
[01:08.61]but this evening, they are not doing their homework. | 但今晚他们没有做作业。
[01:13.38]At the moment, they are playing in the garden. | 此刻，他们正在花园里玩耍。
[01:19.24]It is nine o'clock. | 九点了。
[01:22.10]Mr. Sawyer usually reads his newspaper at night. | 萨维尔先生通常晚上看报纸。
[01:27.29]But he's not reading his newspaper tonight. | 但今晚他没有看报纸。
[01:32.06]At the moment, he's reading an interesting book. | 此刻，他正在读一本有趣的书。